{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for events, private sessions, and membership inquiries.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg1:#f6efe6;
      --bg2:#efe1d6;
      --accent:#8b5e3c;
      --muted:#6b5443;
      --card:#fffaf7;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(101,67,33,0.12);
    }
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family: "Georgia", "Times New Roman", serif;
      color:var(--muted);
      background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
    }
    .pattern {
      position:fixed;
      inset:0;
      pointer-events:none;
      opacity:0.16;
    }
    header{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:1rem;
      padding:28px clamp(18px,3vw,48px);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    }
    .brand{
      display:flex;
      gap:12px;
      align-items:center;
    }
    .logo{
      width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(139,94,60,0.14),rgba(139,94,60,0.06));
      display:grid;place-items:center;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);
    }
    nav a{margin-left:18px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
    .hero{
      max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto;padding:36px;
      display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start;
    }
    .hero .copy{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(255,255,255,0.4));
      padding:28px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)
    }
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;color:var(--accent)}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    form label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:6px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(107,84,67,0.12);font-size:15px}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .cta{
      display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b77a52,#8b5e3c);color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;
      box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(139,94,60,0.18)
    }
    .info-list{margin-top:12px;padding-left:18px}
    .section{
      max-width:1100px;margin:20px auto;padding:0 28px 28px 28px;
      display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:28px;
    }
    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:#6b4940;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,250,248,0.9),rgba(255,250,248,0.6));padding:12px;border-radius:10px}
    footer{padding:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    @media (max-width:900px){
      .hero,.section{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      nav a{display:none}
      .logo{width:48px;height:48px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 1200 800" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#fff3ea" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#efe1d6" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
      </linearGradient>
      <pattern id="p" width="200" height="200" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(15)">
        <rect width="200" height="200" fill="url(#g1)"/>
        <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="2.6" fill="#d9b39a" opacity="0.55"/>
        <circle cx="80" cy="120" r="1.8" fill="#caa689" opacity="0.45"/>
        <path d="M0 160 Q50 140 100 160 T200 160" stroke="#e8d6c9" stroke-width="2" fill="none" opacity="0.5"/>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p)"></rect>
  </svg>

  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">SB</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Main">
      <a href="index.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="events.html">Upcoming</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Membership</a>
      <a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="contact-hero">
      <div class="copy card">
        <h1 id="contact-hero">Let's make space together</h1>
        <p class="lead">Whether you're curious about a first sound bath, arranging a private 1:1, or exploring membership perks, {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} and the circle at {{VENUE_NAME}} are here to guide you. Share a note and we'll respond within two business days.</p>

        <h3 style="margin-top:18px;color:var(--accent)">How I can help</h3>
        <ul class="info-list">
          <li>Reserve a spot at an upcoming event (see "Upcoming").</li>
          <li>Book private sessions — 1:1, couples, or corporate (tailored sessions available).</li>
          <li>Learn about membership benefits and priority booking.</li>
        </ul>

        <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="card">
        <form action="#" method="post" aria-label="Contact form">
          <label for="name">Full name</label>
          <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required>

          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}" required>

          <label for="phone">Phone</label>
          <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">

          <label for="interest">I'm contacting about</label>
          <select id="interest" name="interest">
            <option>General question</option>
            <option>Upcoming events</option>
            <option>Private session — 1:1</option>
            <option>Private session — Couples</option>
            <option>Private session — Corporate</option>
            <option>Membership</option>
          </select>

          <label for="message">Message</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us a bit about what you're seeking"></textarea>

          <label style="font-size:12px;margin-top:12px"><input type="checkbox" required> I confirm I want to be contacted about scheduling and membership.</label>

          <button type="submit" class="cta" style="width:100%;display:block;text-align:center">Send inquiry</button>
        </form>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="what-to-bring">
      <div>
        <h2 id="what-to-bring" style="color:var(--accent)">What to bring & how it feels</h2>
        <p class="lead">A sound bath is a sensory journey. To make it comfortable and restorative, bring items that help you settle into stillness.</p>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Suggested kit</h3>
          <ul class="info-list">
            <li>Yoga mat or meditation pad</li>
            <li>Comfortable blanket and a pillow for head support</li>
            <li>Water bottle (non-glass advised)</li>
            <li>Eye mask or scarf to soften light</li>
            <li>Optional: journal for post-session reflections</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h3 style="margin-top:18px;color:var(--accent)">Flow of a typical session</h3>
        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <ol style="padding-left:18px;margin:0">
            <li><strong>Arrival & settling:</strong> Gentle check-in and orientation (10–15 min).</li>
            <li><strong>Intent & breath:</strong> Guided breathing and intention setting.</li>
            <li><strong>Sound journey:</strong> A layered soundscape (30–50 min) featuring gong, crystal bowls, chimes, and a monochord — designed to move you through sensation to rest.</li>
            <li><strong>Return & sharing:</strong> Transition with grounding tones, space for tea and quiet reflection.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Contraindications & safety</h4>
          <p class="disclaimer">Sound baths are deeply relaxing but not suitable for everyone. Please consult your healthcare provider before attending if you have any of the following: pregnancy (especially first trimester), uncontrolled epilepsy, recent surgeries, implanted medical devices (e.g., pacemakers), severe PTSD triggers, or an active psychiatric episode. If you use medication that affects balance or consciousness, consider attending with a companion. This list is informational and not exhaustive.</p>

          <h4 style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--accent)">Accessibility & notes</h4>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)">We welcome sensory needs. Rooms are low-light, and sessions are fragrance-free. Contact us to discuss reasonable accommodations.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="membership">
      <div>
        <h2 id="membership" style="color:var(--accent)">Membership & ongoing circles</h2>
        <p class="lead">Our membership is crafted for regular nurturers: priority booking, member-only sessions, and seasonal workshops led by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</p>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">Membership perks</h4>
          <ul class="info-list">
            <li>Priority RSVP and reserved seating</li>
            <li>Monthly members-only sound gatherings</li>
            <li>Discounts on private sessions and workshops</li>
            <li>Exclusive guided meditations and audio resources</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="cta" href="pricing.html" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:12px">Learn about membership</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Quick contact</h4>
          <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0"><strong>Email</strong><br>{{EMAIL}}</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0"><strong>Phone</strong><br>{{PHONE}}</p>
          <p style="margin:0"><strong>Location</strong><br>{{VENUE_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-preview">
      <div>
        <h2 id="faq-preview" style="color:var(--accent)">Common questions</h2>
        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">How early should I arrive?</h4>
          <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;color:var(--muted)">Please arrive 10–15 minutes early to settle and sign in.</p>

          <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Can I attend if I have hearing aids?</h4>
          <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;color:var(--muted)">Yes, though some instruments offer deep vibrations; we can suggest seating that feels safest.</p>

          <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Is there parking?</h4>
          <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;color:var(--muted)">Street parking and a small lot are available near {{VENUE_NAME}}. Check the event listing for specifics.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Small group & private booking</h4>
          <p style="color:var(--muted)">We host intimate groups and bespoke corporate wellness sessions. For private inquiries, select "Private session" in the contact form or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px 28px">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center">
        <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{VENUE_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        <div><a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a> | <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a></div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;color:#7b5a49">Made with warmth — membership model for dedicated community</div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Sound Bath — Contact page (chunk 4)

This bundle contains two files for the contact page of the sound bath site (layoutFamily: earthy_warm, voiceFamily: warm_storyteller, offerModel: membership).

Files included:
- contact.html   -> The full contact page with inline SVG background pattern, form UI, membership info, what-to-bring, contraindications, and session flow.
- README.md      -> This file.

Usage:
1. Replace placeholders in the HTML with real values:
   - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
   - {{TAGLINE}}
   - {{PHONE}}
   - {{EMAIL}}
   - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
   - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
   - {{CITY}}
   - {{STATE}}
   - {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}
   - {{VENUE_NAME}}
   - {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}} (if referenced elsewhere)

2. Hook the contact form to your backend by changing the form action and method as appropriate.

Design notes:
- Visual richness is achieved through CSS gradients, shadows, and an inline SVG pattern (no external assets).
- Tone: warm storyteller; copy emphasizes sensory, premium experience and membership benefits.
- Safety: contact.html includes a contraindications disclaimer and accessibility notes.

Accessibility & best practices:
- Labels are associated with inputs; color contrasts are kept warm but readable.
- Provide server-side validation and anti-spam measures on the form.
- Ensure event pages and private-sessions pages referenced in nav exist and follow unique section orders and headings (do not reuse exact headings across templates).

If you need an external SVG file at assets/img/pattern.svg, you can extract the inline <svg> element from contact.html and save it there. Otherwise the inline pattern renders the same visuals without external requests.

